id: pm-gh1700
title: "GH-1700: pm test --add returns only the changed linked test, like pm comments --add"
description: "GitHub issue 1700 (reported against 2026.11.10): every 'pm test <id> --add' echoes the item's whole linked-test list with provenance, plus a failure_categories block of nine zero counters. 'pm comments <id> --add' returns only the new entry, count/total_count/has_more, a mutation_receipt and an omission_receipt. The issue measures 485 B for a comment add on an item with 7 comments, 369 B for a test add with 2 linked tests and 3,335 B for a test add with 26 linked tests. Agents link 20-40 tests per item over a PR's life, so each add re-sends a list that grows linearly. Expected: one collection-mutation receipt shape across comments, files, docs and test. --add/--remove return only the changed entries, the counts and a mutation_receipt. failure_categories appears only for --run. The full list remains reachable through the omission_receipt restore flag. Observed in this session too: linking one test to pm-gh1699 echoed the full receipt. Duplicate check: searched 'test --add echoes linked tests receipt failure_categories' and 'collection mutation receipt files docs test add only changed entries'. pm-covpax (closed) compacted zero failure categories only on lean --run receipts, and pm-gh1630 (closed) bounded selective --run receipts. Neither covers the add/remove mutation receipt."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[5]: agent-ux,"gh:1700",linked-tests,receipts,token-efficiency
created_at: "2026-11-10T14:43:04.434Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-11T08:02:17.888Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-11T08:02:12.961Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-11T08:02:12.961Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "A test --add on an item with 26 linked tests returns a receipt whose size does not grow with the existing list, matching the comments --add shape; failure_categories is absent from add/remove receipts and unchanged on --run receipts; The omission_receipt names the flag or command that restores the full linked-test list, and executing it returns every linked test; files and docs --add are measured and follow the same shape when they share the code path; CLI, SDK and MCP receipts stay in parity"
parent: pm-5t33or
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "projectLinkedCollectionMutation (src/sdk/linked-artifacts.ts) bounds every test, files and docs write to the persisted entries it added or rewrote. A write reports count (returned entries), total_count, returned_count, has_more, mutation_receipt (changed_count, removed_count, full_history_included) and the annotation omission_receipt with the full_history selector. --full-history (SDK fullHistory, MCP full) returns the whole collection. failure_categories appears only when tests ran. The implicit post-write path check covers returned links. Measurement-refusal retries replay --full-history. Flag contracts, completions, MCP schema 4.24.0, a new replication set and docs carry the contract, and the SDK surface records the breaking acknowledgement with migration guidance."
expected_result: "A test --add on an item with 26 linked tests returns a receipt that does not grow with the existing list, and the full list stays reachable"
actual_result: "The receipt is 900 B as JSON (the issue measured 3,335 B); 3-test and 27-test items differ by at most one byte; --full-history returns every entry on CLI, SDK and MCP"
